{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15663","headline":"过钱员外 · 司空曙","name":"过钱员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲郎头已白，迹向市朝稀。\n移病居荒宅，安贫着败衣。\n野园随客醉，雪寺伴僧归。\n自说东峯下，松萝满故扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}